error: the left operand of a logical operator must be `bool`, found `option[int32]`
  --> 032_or_with_option_operand.cn:6:12
    6 |     return o or true
      |            ^ expected `bool` here
  help:  Cinder has no truthiness; write an explicit comparison such as `x != 0` or `!list.is_empty()`. Did you mean `or else`? `x or else y` gives the value inside the `option`, or `y` when there is none.

